/**
 * Cryptography Type Converters
 *
 * This module provides converter functions between cryptographic branded types.
 * All converters include:
 * - Input assertions to validate the source type
 * - Range/constraint validation to ensure lossless conversion
 * - Output assertions to validate the result type
 *
 * ## Conversion Categories
 *
 * ### Field Element Conversions
 * - U256 <-> Bn254FieldElement
 * - U256 <-> Curve25519FieldElement
 * - Bn254FieldElement <-> Curve25519FieldElement (cross-field)
 *
 * ### Cipher Type Conversions
 * - Bn254FieldElement -> Poseidon types (promotion)
 * - Curve25519FieldElement -> Rescue types (promotion)
 * - Poseidon types -> Bn254FieldElement (extraction)
 * - Rescue types -> Curve25519FieldElement (extraction)
 *
 * ### X25519 Key Conversions
 * - X25519Bytes <-> X25519PrivateKey
 * - X25519Bytes <-> X25519PublicKey
 * - X25519Bytes <-> SharedSecret
 *
 * ### U256 Splitting Utilities
 * - U256 -> two U128 halves
 * - X25519PublicKey -> two U128 halves (little-endian)
 * - U256 -> Base85LimbTuple (three ~85-bit limbs for ZK circuits)
 *
 * @packageDocumentation
 * @module utils/convertors/cryptography
 * @public
 */

/**
 * Converts a U256 to a Bn254FieldElement.
